OL,3,ANetflix to cut 1,000 jobs worldwide
OL,4,
OL,5,FNetflix has said it will cut 1,000 jobs
OL,6,Fglobally as the streaming giant faces
OL,7,Fcompetition from rivals.
OL,9,FThe cuts - the steepest since 2022 -
OL,10,Fwill mainly affect its human resources,
OL,11,Flegal, product and technology teams and
OL,12,Fequates to around 6% of its total
OL,13,Fworkforce.
OL,15,FLast month, Netflix 's co-chief
OL,16,Fexecutive, Ted Sarandos, told the
OL,17,FBloomberg Screentime summit that the
OL,18,Fcompany was "not growing as fast as I
OL,19,Fwant us to".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
