OL,3,ANetflix to cut 1,000 jobs worldwide
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe streaming industry is going through
OL,6,Fa period of consolidation following
OL,7,FParamount's $110bn (#83.6bn) merger
OL,8,Fwith Warner Bros, the owner of HBO,
OL,9,Fwhile free platforms such as YouTube
OL,10,Fand TikTok continue to attract viewers.
